  "reading": "Picture a whole outlaw crew roaring down the street on motorcycles, all wearing matching jackets: that's the Zoku gang (ぞく). Every one of those robbers can't wait to join up, because a Zoku gang means fast bikes, easy loot, and no rules.",
  "made": "2026-09-26T06:23:43.432Z",
  "fresh": false
