  "reading": "You ask this refusing mouth if it wants a piece of hot pizza fresh from the oven. It says no. You ask if it wants ice cream instead — still no. So you hold up a warm slice right under its nose and it finally cracks: 'Fine, I'll take a bite, but only because it's hot.' The word for that heat is ひ, and even the mouth that always says no can't refuse it.",
